 ; Cross-validation tests (Phase 50.10) need to read contrib/parser/*.mere
 ; and contrib/fmt/*.mere via Mere's `import` machinery. Dune runs the
 ; test binary from `_build/default/test`, so the test resolves the
 ; project root at runtime by walking up to the first ancestor
 ; containing `dune-project`.
 ; ../docs: the version check reads docs/changelog.md, so the sandbox needs it.
 ; Lower case, which is the name in the tree — the first version of this said CHANGELOG
 ; and the code that matched it opened fine here and raised on the Linux runner.
 (deps (source_tree ../contrib) (source_tree ../scripts) (source_tree ../docs)))
